{
  "title": "Managoat / Latency",
  "uid": "managoat-latency",
  "tags": [
    "managoat",
    "latency",
    "sandboxes"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "prometheus"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "DS_TEMPO",
        "label": "Tempo",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "tempo",
        "current": {
          "text": "Tempo",
          "value": "tempo"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "Namespace",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(fountain_turn_completed_duration_ms_count, namespace)",
          "refId": "namespace"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "fountain",
          "value": "fountain"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "provider",
        "label": "Provider",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(fountain_turn_completed_duration_ms_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}, provider)",
          "refId": "provider"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "runtime",
        "label": "Runtime",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(fountain_turn_completed_duration_ms_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\"}, runtime)",
          "refId": "runtime"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "turn_class",
        "label": "Turn",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "first,followup",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "window",
        "label": "Rolling window",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "5m,15m,30m,1h,6h",
        "current": {
          "text": "30m",
          "value": "30m"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "5m",
            "value": "5m",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "15m",
            "value": "15m",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "30m",
            "value": "30m",
            "selected": true
          },
          {
            "text": "1h",
            "value": "1h",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "6h",
            "value": "6h",
            "selected": false
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this measures",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Live application telemetry. Provider/runtime filters apply to preparation and turn timings; the Turn filter applies to turn/response panels. Stage failures remain global.\n\n**First text** is the first nonempty assistant text chunk, excluding reasoning and tools. **Request \u2192 first text** starts inside the application launch/send-prompt entry point and includes admission, queueing, preparation or wake. Paths: cold = launch with prompt; warm = existing server; wake = no server. Warm can include waiting for an already-starting server. It excludes client/network/rendering delay. Promptless launches emit no cold-response sample; later prompts start their own clocks. Reattached output after a process restart has no response sample.\n\n**First visible update** can be reasoning, a tool or a plan. Turn timings start before runtime spawn/session reuse. First/follow-up means conversation turn number. Models and reasoning settings are pooled in metrics; requested/effective models are trace attributes. Preparation steps can overlap: do not sum durations or percentiles.\n\nCheck sample counts and failures alongside latency. No samples means no data. Histogram percentiles are estimates. New labels and first-text series only exist after the instrumentation deployment. Trace searches show all providers; open a trace for its attributes."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "First visible update \u00b7 p50 / p95",
      "description": "Turn start to first agent text/thinking/tool/plan; not ACP handshake, not necessarily response text. Grouped by provider/runtime; pooled models; the Turn filter selects first or follow-up turns.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (provider,runtime,le) (rate(fountain_turn_first_update_elapsed_ms_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\",turn_class=~\"$turn_class\"}[$window]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{runtime}} p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (provider,runtime,le) (rate(fountain_turn_first_update_elapsed_ms_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\",turn_class=~\"$turn_class\"}[$window]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{runtime}} p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Successful turn completion \u00b7 p50 / p95",
      "description": "Application turn duration for completed turns only. Includes runtime/session startup where needed. Pooled task complexity; compare similar workloads.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (provider,runtime,le) (rate(fountain_turn_completed_duration_ms_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\",turn_class=~\"$turn_class\",status=\"completed\"}[$window]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{runtime}} p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (provider,runtime,le) (rate(fountain_turn_completed_duration_ms_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\",turn_class=~\"$turn_class\",status=\"completed\"}[$window]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{runtime}} p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "First visible update \u00b7 mean",
      "description": "Histogram sum/count gives the measured mean; unlike quantiles it does not interpolate buckets.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (provider,runtime) (rate(fountain_turn_first_update_elapsed_ms_sum{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\",turn_class=~\"$turn_class\"}[$window])) / sum by (provider,runtime) (rate(fountain_turn_first_update_elapsed_ms_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\",turn_class=~\"$turn_class\"}[$window])) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{runtime}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Visible-update samples per window",
      "description": "Estimated observations in the rolling window. A turn with no visible update contributes no latency sample; use failures alongside this panel.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 30
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (provider,runtime) (increase(fountain_turn_first_update_elapsed_ms_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\",provider=~\"$provider\",runtime=~\"$runtime\",turn_class=~\"$turn_class\"}[$window]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} / {{runtime}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Terminal turn outcomes per window",
      "description": "Completed, failed and interrupted turns with duration observations. Shows failures instead of letting them masquerade as fast successful responses.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38
